No new ambiguity surfaced — owner answers A–F cover coordinates, cart-drop semantics, deep links, checkout propagation, re-entry and delivery precedence, so no `needs-clarification.md` is warranted at triage. The one structural decision I made that a planner could get wrong is called out explicitly: **Sub-task 5 must read the resolver directly rather than take a prop through `HomePage.tsx`**, otherwise it collides with Sub-task 4 and the parallelism collapses.

